{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13727","headline":"哭从兄苌 · 顾况","name":"哭从兄苌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭违鄂渚，嫋嫋秋风时。\n何人不客游，独与帝子期。\n黄鹄铩飞翅，青云叹沈姿。\n身终一骑曹，高盖者爲谁。\n从驾至梁汉，金根复京师。\n皇恩溢九垠，不记屠沽儿。\n立身有高节，满卷多好诗。\n赫赫承明庭，羣公默无词。\n草木正摇落，哭兄鄱水湄。\n共居云阳里，轗轲多别离。\n人生倏忽间，旅衬飘若遗。\n稚子新学拜，枯杨生一枝。\n人生倏忽间，精爽无不之。\n旧国数千里，家人由未知。\n人生倏忽间，安用才士爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13727.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13727","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}